{"metadata":{"symbolKind":"module","externalID":"TracingDestinations","modules":[{"name":"TracingDestinations"}],"role":"collection","roleHeading":"Framework","title":"TracingDestinations"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/tracingdestinations"]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A destination that adds each tracked event to the span that was active when it was tracked."}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/TracingDestinations\/documentation\/TracingDestinations","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/TracingDestinations\/documentation\/TracingDestinations\/SpanEventDestination"],"anchor":"Destinations","title":"Destinations"}],"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/TracingDestinations\/documentation\/TracingDestinations\/SpanEventDestination","type":"reference"},{"text":" finds each record’s span from the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ServiceContext"},{"text":" the event was tracked","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"in, so a delivery that runs later, under another span or none, still adds the event to the right","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"one. Each span event is named after the event, stamped with the time it was tracked, and carries","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the event’s description under ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"event"},{"text":" and its call site under OpenTelemetry’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"code.*"},{"text":" attribute","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"names.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Span events can’t be added to a span that has ended. A record tracked outside any span, or whose"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"span ended before its batch was delivered, is left out. Batch tightly enough for your spans to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"outlive their batches, and deliver to another destination as well for the events that must not be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"lost. To write events to your logs instead, use "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"LoggerDestination"},{"type":"text","text":" in the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"LoggingDestinations"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"module."}]},{"code":["let tracker = Tracker()","let delivery = tracker.records.batch().deliver(to: SpanEventDestination(tracer: tracer))","let span = tracer.startSpan(\"checkout\")","ServiceContext.withValue(span.context) {","    tracker.track(SignedUp(plan: \"pro\"))","}","await tracker.finish()","try await delivery.execute()","span.end()"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The umbrella guide on this area is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/traffluent\/choosingdestinations","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"https://tyler-keith-thompson.github.io/Traffluent/documentation/traffluent/choosingdestinations":{"titleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Choosing Destinations"}],"title":"Choosing Destinations","identifier":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/traffluent\/choosingdestinations","url":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/traffluent\/choosingdestinations","type":"link"},"doc://TracingDestinations/documentation/TracingDestinations":{"url":"\/documentation\/tracingdestinations","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/TracingDestinations\/documentation\/TracingDestinations","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A destination that adds each tracked event to the span that was active when it was tracked."}],"title":"TracingDestinations","kind":"symbol","role":"collection"},"doc://TracingDestinations/documentation/TracingDestinations/SpanEventDestination":{"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"SpanEventDestination"}],"title":"SpanEventDestination","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/TracingDestinations\/documentation\/TracingDestinations\/SpanEventDestination","url":"\/documentation\/tracingdestinations\/spaneventdestination","abstract":[{"text":"A destination that adds each event to the span that was active when the event was tracked.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"SpanEventDestination"}]}}}